SystemRequirements: Prebuilt backends require Linux x86_64 with glibc 2.28 or
    newer. GPU-backed operations require a supported NVIDIA GPU and driver 580
    or newer. The managed runtime uses CUDA Toolkit 13.2.2, RAPIDS cuML and
    nvForest 26.06, and Treelite 4.7.0.
